                        "language": "english",
                        "review": "It's not that good.\r\nIt's quite similar to Accent Core, but there are two fields to fight on since it's based around 2v2 fighting. You have to turn your character automatically which gets tedious, might not be too bad if you're used to it.\r\nThe controls were completely mirrored on my 8bitdo fightstick, which wasn't that annoying since it was easy to rebind it in the settings, but the issue I got after playing a bit is that my B input stopped working, and I can't for my life get it working again. \r\nThe music is good, the art is fantastic and the 2v2 is interesting but not good enough to warrant it.\r\nI'd recommend getting Accent Core instead.\r\n",
